WEBVTT

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.660
But I don't want to.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.500
Don't you already have several girlfriends?

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:25.840
What? I'm not going out with anyone.

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:29.210
Then I want to be your first.

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:32.700
Kippei's first girlfriend.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:35.850
All right.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.140
Why you...

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:47.240
Ouch! Sensei, what are you doing here?

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:48.760
Isn't it time for class?

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.400
It is time for class. So what are you doing?

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.030
What am I doing?

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:03.220
I take my eyes off of you for just one second and you're off somewhere else fooling around.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.710
Why bother coming to school?

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:13.100
What's the matter, Kippei? Nice forehead!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.520
He was making out with some girl instead of going to class.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.790
The teacher found them and beat him up.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.120
What an idiot!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:23.450
Hey, can I touch it?

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:24.250
No!

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:26.360
Doing that at school, are you stupid?

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.260
Right, Kokoro?

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:45.040
You know you'll get in trouble if you keep chasing all these girls, right?

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:49.170
I don't go after girls... all the girls come to me.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.050
Oh, the humanity! Do not be so easily fooled!

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:55.810
Oh?

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:58.430
Kokoro, you're going home?

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:01.100
It's only second period...

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.340
I'm feeling tired today.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.030
Take care of yourself.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:11.590
Idiot.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:21.940
You know, sometimes...

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.380
I think that Tokunaga might...

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:26.280
like me.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.350
I doubt it.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:32.930
Are you serious?

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:34.310
Well...

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:35.630
You mean...

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:37.160
That's right.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:39.590
What are we going to do?

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:50.750
Kippei!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.020
You're going home already?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.030
Yeah, I'm leaving.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.410
Are you free?

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:56.370
Very.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.080
If you're free just say so!

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:01.570
You should hang out with me. We haven't hung out lately.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:03.530
Okay.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.220
Yay!

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.950
Okay, but you're heavy.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.360
Where do you want to go?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.310
Your house.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:11.830
Nope.

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.230
One second, that's my phone.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:20.120
Kippei! Come home right now!

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.740
If you don't, I'll kill you! Got it?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.460
W-What was... that?

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:30.380
Sorry... I actually need to go home.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.750
But... why?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.090
It can't be helped, it's an emergency.

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.110
I wonder if that rumor is true.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:44.180
You know, the one that Kippei is living with an older woman.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.820
It can't be...

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.360
You can say that, but...

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:55.790
What have I done to get in trouble?

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.030
I'm home!

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:11.420
Nee-chan?

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:13.540
Yuzuyu.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.960
Yuzuyu?

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.180
Are you an idiot?

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:21.720
What do you mean "Nee-chan?"

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.380
You scared me, I thought you had shrunk.

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:25.900
Idiot!

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:30.950
Yuzuyu-chan, would you like to go watch some TV?

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:32.030
Okay!

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.170
Who is that girl?

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:38.940
It's all right. Come with me...

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.250
What's with this atmosphere?

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:50.790
What's wrong with everyone?

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:52.280
You all look so serious.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.220
Shut up and sit down!

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:01.480
Um...

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:04.480
Has something happened?

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.780
And who is that girl?

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.960
You have to stay calm and listen.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:15.790
You know my younger sister, your Aunt Miyako?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.050
Yeah.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:21.660
There's trouble...

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.440
Trouble?

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:26.090
She has disappeared.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.050
What? Disappeared?

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.060
Keep your voice down!

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:31.180
How? When?

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.090
Well, even if you say “disappear,” it's not magic.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.370
Oh... right...

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:41.350
After her husband died, she didn't have the confidence to raise Yuzuyu-chan on her own.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.350
So she vanished.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.790
Oh, I see.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:49.150
Satsuki, are you really twelve years old?

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:51.080
I am.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.330
By the way, what do you mean by “vanished”?

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:54.730
Kippei!

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:55.290
Yes?

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:56.900
Keep your voice down.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:57.820
Okay.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:07.220
Anyway, we will have to take care of her until we find Aunt Miyako.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.760
Everyone should keep that in mind.

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:17.070
So that girl is Aunt Miyako's daughter.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:35.260
It's just like a drama, isn't it?

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:36.370
Kippei!

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.260
Sorry. I'll be quiet.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:41.850
You take care of her!

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.250
Why?

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:45.640
Why, you ask?

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:47.580
Yesterday some girl came to the house.

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.670
She asked me to give something to you.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.630
And handed me an axe!

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.440
I-I wonder who that was.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.730
What do you do after you leave the house?

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.460
Go baby-sit and learn to behave.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:01.550
An axe?

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.020
Did I do something to deserve that?

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:08.300
Another phone call from a girl? You don't need this!

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:13.180
What are you doing? Seriously...

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:22.640
If I were to ever bring a girl over, Nee-chan would try to kill me.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:26.510
Can't you two just be quiet?

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:29.630
Dear, could you please say something to them?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.980
Oh... what's wrong, Yuzuyu-chan?

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:38.680
Bathroom.

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:42.060
You need to go to the bathroom? Well then...

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.300
Yuzuyu-chan, until we find your mommy...

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:48.000
that guy is going to take care of you.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:49.570
The stupid one over there.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:50.280
Hey!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.870
Don't be ridiculous...

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:02.850
You should already know this, but...

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:04.990
if you lay a hand on her, I'll cut your throat.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.690
She's only five years old!

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:08.770
I'm not going to lay a hand on her.

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.350
Anyway, I'm not desperate.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:11.810
You should be desperate.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:13.290
That desperate?

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.690
No, I'd rather you died.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.030
How stupid...

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.750
Yuzuyu-chan, I'll take you to the bathroom.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:21.760
Okay!

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.400
Well, we'll be going now.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.600
Well, Kippei, that's how it is.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:28.430
Take care of her.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:32.570
What? You mean I really have to...

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:37.120
I mean, why? Why me?!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:00.350
Here.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:02.950
It's a map to her preschool.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:04.610
Huh?

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:05.960
Don't get lost.

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:17.450
Okay, see you later!

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:19.950
I'm going!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.090
I'm going...

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.920
So, how do we get there?

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:28.650
I can't tell from this map.

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:32.440
I'm looking forward to my new preschool!

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.720
After her husband died...

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.720
she didn't have the confidence to raise Yuzuyu-chan on her own...

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.160
so she vanished.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:43.920
By the way...

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.160
Huh?

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:47.600
Aren't you lonely?

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:50.760
I'm okay!

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:52.540
Then you're a good girl.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.110
Good girl?

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:58.790
Yeah, a good girl...

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:03.390
What? You're still here?

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:04.110
Huh?

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.960
Yuzuyu-chan is going to be late if you don't hurry.

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:08.530
Huh? What time is it?

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.320
It's 8:15.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.480
Hey! I'm going to be late!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.850
The people in this house don't care about me at all!

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:19.490
We're going to be late! Let's go!

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:20.970
Okay, let's hurry!

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:22.750
See you later.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.180
Oops...

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:28.610
Come on then.

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:29.520
Okay!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.980
K-Ki...

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:35.150
What's that? Ki?

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:39.400
K-K-Kippei-onii-chan. I don't have my lunch.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.060
What?

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:44.470
This will have to do for today.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:46.420
Here, your rice balls.

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:51.120
I don't have a lunch either, my parents don't make it for me.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.080
I love rice balls!

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.490
Oh, that's good.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:58.710
What time is it now?

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:01.620
We're late!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.450
Hurry!

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:04.410
My hat!

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:16.040
Please pick her up at three o'clock.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:17.650
Okay.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:20.300
Later. Do your best.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:21.860
Okay.

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.050
What am I doing?

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:44.570
Hey... Kippei still isn't here yet?

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.210
I wonder what's wrong? Right, Kokoro?

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:50.840
Why are you asking me?

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.020
Hey... here he is.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:59.490
Oh my god. What happened, Kippei?

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:05.360
I... don't... want... kids.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.880
Sensei! Kippei is saying he doesn't want children.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.790
The womanizer seems to be speaking from experience.

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:16.430
Why do I have to put up with this?

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:19.970
Let's eat!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:36.240
Didn't I tell them to provide a homemade lunch?

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:39.680
My mama made me my lunch.

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:44.800
Doesn't your mama make your lunch?

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:48.210
Hey, Ken-kun, let's stop right there.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:52.650
I love rice balls, so it's okay.

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:55.560
Kids are scary...

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:02.890
Hey, you have extra lessons today.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:07.110
What was your test score last time?

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:09.800
Really bad, wasn't it?

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:10.810
Wha...?

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:14.670
Oh, actually I can't today. I have plans.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.660
What kind of plans?

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:18.980
I have to go pick someone up from preschool.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:21.400
Oh my... so you really do have a child?

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:24.040
Sensei, is that really how you see me?

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:26.560
That's so mean!

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:28.280
You don't have to make up excuses.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.580
If you want to skip your extra lessons, it doesn't bother me.

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.150
I won't just give you better grades.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:33.610
What did you say?

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:39.780
Yuzuyu-chan.

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:44.880
He should be here soon, so be a good girl and wait. Okay?

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:47.190
I'll go wait!

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:57.130
So?

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.060
Yeah, she's playing.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:03.380
Didn't Yuzuyu-chan's mom disappear?

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:06.160
Her dad isn't around either.

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:07.030
Really?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.190
Poor girl...

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:22.560
Yuzuyu, be a good girl until Mama comes home.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:35.420
Mama?

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.170
Mama...

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:06.440
Crap! I'm late!

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:07.270
Sensei!

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:10.030
Where's my child?

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:11.140
Have you looked for her?

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:12.220
Of course I've looked!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.150
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.010
Ah, sensei!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:18.930
I'm sorry! Yuzuyu-chan has disappeared!

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:20.410
What?

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:26.230
Where have you gone?

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:27.870
Nee-chan is going to kill me.

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:46.810
This can't be happening...

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:51.100
Huh?

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:58.570
Hey...

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:01.510
What are you doing?

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.130
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:13.310
Well, it's okay... now that I've found you. We're going home.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.110
Going home?

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:16.140
I get to go home?

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:17.640
Yeah.

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:19.500
To my house.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:29.960
Hey, what's wrong?

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:33.940
Hey...

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:42.560
Is it because I was late?

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:43.780
I'm very sorry.

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:48.800
I'll be on time tomorrow. Okay?

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:57.380
I want to eat Mama's rice balls...

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:05.180
but I could never eat them all.

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:10.200
So now Mama hates me.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:17.760
I'll be a good girl, so please take me to Mama!

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:24.810
I love my mama!

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:28.050
Aren't you lonely?

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.960
No one hates you...

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:53.950
I'll make them...

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:01.780
I'll make your rice balls.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:43.340
W-What's wrong?

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:55.270
Someone dropped this clothespin in the hall.

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:59.250
T-Thank you.

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:04.360
Well then... good night.

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:11.200
Eh, what? Maybe...

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.040
You want to sleep in here with me?

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:22.560
What could I do? She's just too cute.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:24.290
What's this book?

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:27.180
This? This is my picture book.

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:28.330
Would you like to see?

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:29.100
Yeah!

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:32.200
Just kidding. You can't.

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:41.610
Well, it'll all work out in the end.

00:23:42.640 --> 00:23:45.040
She'll have to get along with Kippei.

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:48.630
I couldn't look after Yuzuyu-chan.

00:23:49.270 --> 00:23:50.630
I'm not good with children.

00:23:52.210 --> 00:23:52.810
Finished!

00:24:19.040 --> 00:24:21.320
All right! Time to make rice balls.

00:24:24.620 --> 00:24:25.970
Hang on... I don't know how to make them.

00:24:26.320 --> 00:24:27.990
K-Kippei-onii-chan.

00:24:28.860 --> 00:24:33.090
Don't worry, Yuzuyu. I'll make you some really good ones. Just wait.

00:24:33.530 --> 00:24:35.060
Okay, so you go like this...

00:24:35.230 --> 00:24:35.980
Here... oops.

00:24:36.120 --> 00:24:36.720
Like this?

00:24:37.520 --> 00:24:38.010
Just a little more...

00:24:38.330 --> 00:24:39.000
Oh no!

00:24:39.520 --> 00:24:40.240
Oh no?

00:24:40.450 --> 00:24:41.420
Try your best!

00:24:41.990 --> 00:24:43.680
Next time on Aishitereze Baby...

00:24:44.200 --> 00:24:45.280
Yuzu's rice ball!

00:24:46.120 --> 00:24:47.150
Look forward to it!
